{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14114240","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14114240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1411424001:1":{"text":"방금 또 폭발음을 들었어. 다들 괜찮아?","source_cn":"刚刚我又听见爆炸声了，你们还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F735F6199C17C6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1411424002:1":{"text":"괜찮아. 그 악마... 그러니까, 한 여자애가 한 짓이야.","source_cn":"没事，是那个恶魔……我是说那个小丫头干的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAD535D5D36E95FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1411424003:1":{"text":"어? 너희도 쿠루루를 만났어?","source_cn":"哦？你们也碰上库露露了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C59D7A3B1021682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1411424003":{"text":"어? 너희도 쿠루루를 만났어?","source_cn":"哦？你们也碰上库露露了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C59D7A3B1021682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1411424004:1":{"text":"우리 사이에서는 꽤 유명인이야! 성격도 엄청 좋고.","source_cn":"她这两天在我们这很出名啊！毕竟她性格挺好的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x048572CFDB7DC9B8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리 사이에서는 꽤 유명인이야! 성격도 엄청 좋고.","female":"우리 사이에서는 꽤 유명인이야! 성격도 엄청 좋고.","variant_male_record_index":"168697","variant_female_record_index":"168698","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1411424005:1":{"text":"...성격이, 좋다고?","source_cn":"……性格，好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76A4A939D2BD0FFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1411424006:1":{"text":"응. 너희도 그 뾰족귀들 만났지? 뾰족귀들은 하나같이 폼만 잡고 말도 이상하게 하잖아.","source_cn":"是啊，你也见过那帮尖耳朵吧？一个个装腔作势拿腔拿调的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37759C1D9F7F070D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1411424007:1":{"text":"그런데 쿠루루는 솔직하고 밝아. 모르는 건 물어보고 붙임성도 좋아서 다들 좋아해.","source_cn":"但是那小丫头就很直率，又开朗，不懂的也会问，大家都挺喜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3C55198C38E5001","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1411424008:1":{"text":"...솔직하고, 밝고... 뭐, 그렇긴 하지...","source_cn":"……直率，开朗，倒也确实……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3DB1D6D237A5878","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1411424009:1":{"text":"그러고 보니 아까 쿠루루와 싸울 때 조아는 한 마디도 안 했네요.","source_cn":"说起来，刚刚跟库露露吵架的时候，祖娅居然一句话都没说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13BC062338EFF40F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1411424010:1":{"text":"그 나이 또래 애들이 제일 골치 아프거든. 말은 안 듣고 반항심만 강하고, 세상에서 자기가 제일 잘났다고 생각하니까 말이야.","source_cn":"我最头疼这个年龄段的小孩了，又叛逆，又闹腾，说什么都不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFF05ED053849400","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1411424011:1":{"text":"하지만 조아도 그 나이에는 그러지 않았을까요... ","source_cn":"可你明明也长成这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6E595C216230049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1411424012:1":{"text":"오, 지금 내 모습을 보면 모르겠어?","source_cn":"唉，你看我长这样还不明白？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89F71CDE3BDED590","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1411424013:0":{"text":"그때 내가 얌전했으면 드래곤의 알 에센스를 마시고 이 꼴이 됐겠냐고!","source_cn":"我在当年那个年纪要是好惹，会误喝龙蛋清让自己变成这模样吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE0D4A55876174BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1411424013":{"text":"그때 내가 얌전했으면 드래곤의 알 에센스를 마시고 이 꼴이 됐겠냐고!","source_cn":"我在当年那个年纪要是好惹，会误喝龙蛋清让自己变成这模样吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE0D4A55876174BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17: